    "detailed_description": "<h1>FOLLOW US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us for the latest info:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/e27e6ac2adf5497909508c868720796e.avif?t=1752734022\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/5af86ab70740e9bbf55bb7102b538b02.avif?t=1752734022\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/4f7ab03f1ad0987b520712e77ea40b4d.avif?t=1752734022\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/43693a3846788a1d1ef8ee1f7986ae9d.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat System</h2></strong><br>Exciting controls, diverse gameplay, cooperative multiplayer, and stunning combos!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6882ad3268d128a33fca916e9b55347e.poster.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6882ad3268d128a33fca916e9b55347e.webm?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6882ad3268d128a33fca916e9b55347e.mp4?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Master advanced techniques, a dazzling counterattack! A beautiful reversal!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/37db1804c194eba174166ec40c84d843.poster.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/37db1804c194eba174166ec40c84d843.webm?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/37db1804c194eba174166ec40c84d843.mp4?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Super moves explode! Sweep the battlefield!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/1699b18b0a969aa5f8f3712ffc4866bd.poster.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/1699b18b0a969aa5f8f3712ffc4866bd.webm?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/1699b18b0a969aa5f8f3712ffc4866bd.mp4?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/e3ae2f4535d23f257e70818f877e0e8f.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Formidable Challenges</h2></strong><br>Robot legions, orc space pirates, visitors from other dimensions, a variety of enemies lie in wait on your adventurous path!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32d9bc35385eda2b217bc8b4b3b9483c.poster.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32d9bc35385eda2b217bc8b4b3b9483c.webm?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32d9bc35385eda2b217bc8b4b3b9483c.mp4?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/434b507d8edc83143752fb296cf19d96.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2></strong><br>You will play as the interstellar ranger [Kelly] or the female combat robot [Muu(No.02)], defeating incoming competitors in search of the universe's ultimate treasure on planet AE-38, driving the ranger ship to ultimate victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/622b9ae0ee94ef63a7bafb023ac404fd.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2></strong><br>Distinctly styled planets, spaces filled with imagination for you to explore at will. Acquire new moves to make combat even more splendid, experience more fun with new equipment, spaceships, and helpers. Collect money, level up, become stronger!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/43693a3846788a1d1ef8ee1f7986ae9d.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat System</h2></strong><br>Exciting controls, diverse gameplay, cooperative multiplayer, and stunning combos!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6882ad3268d128a33fca916e9b55347e.poster.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6882ad3268d128a33fca916e9b55347e.webm?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6882ad3268d128a33fca916e9b55347e.mp4?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Master advanced techniques, a dazzling counterattack! A beautiful reversal!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/37db1804c194eba174166ec40c84d843.poster.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/37db1804c194eba174166ec40c84d843.webm?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/37db1804c194eba174166ec40c84d843.mp4?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Super moves explode! Sweep the battlefield!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/1699b18b0a969aa5f8f3712ffc4866bd.poster.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/1699b18b0a969aa5f8f3712ffc4866bd.webm?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/1699b18b0a969aa5f8f3712ffc4866bd.mp4?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/e3ae2f4535d23f257e70818f877e0e8f.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Formidable Challenges</h2></strong><br>Robot legions, orc space pirates, visitors from other dimensions, a variety of enemies lie in wait on your adventurous path!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32d9bc35385eda2b217bc8b4b3b9483c.poster.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32d9bc35385eda2b217bc8b4b3b9483c.webm?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32d9bc35385eda2b217bc8b4b3b9483c.mp4?t=1752734022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/434b507d8edc83143752fb296cf19d96.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2></strong><br>You will play as the interstellar ranger [Kelly] or the female combat robot [Muu(No.02)], defeating incoming competitors in search of the universe's ultimate treasure on planet AE-38, driving the ranger ship to ultimate victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/622b9ae0ee94ef63a7bafb023ac404fd.avif?t=1752734022\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2></strong><br>Distinctly styled planets, spaces filled with imagination for you to explore at will. Acquire new moves to make combat even more splendid, experience more fun with new equipment, spaceships, and helpers. Collect money, level up, become stronger!",
